{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find, take and check object properties. Perform task if close. Move to destination. Or scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = FindObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
